1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:01,930
Some words are tiny.

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:05,060
They turn up in almost every sentence.

3
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:07,160
Some you can sound out.

4
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:08,560
Some you can't.

5
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:10,800
You just learn them.

6
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:15,420
Learn these eight and you can read a lot.

7
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:17,920
Nice work.

8
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:18,940
Let's build one.

9
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,040
Watch the words arrive.

10
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,720
Now read them together.

11
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:26,140
The words made a picture in your head.

12
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:27,760
That's reading.

13
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:29,940
This one is yours.

14
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:31,560
Did you read it?

15
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:33,910
I knew you could.

16
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:35,760
Now show me what it means.

17
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:38,660
Which picture is this?

18
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:41,520
This one.

19
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:44,780
You read it AND you understood it.

20
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:46,740
One more.

21
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,200
A word is missing.

22
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:49,880
Which word fits?

23
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:52,580
You found it.

24
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:55,550
You just read your first sentences.

25
00:00:57,060 --> 00:01:01,540
Thirty-five sentences like these are waiting in the English Learning app.

26
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:04,660
Tap any word and it says itself.

27
00:01:05,520 --> 00:01:07,090
Free on both stores.
